{"id":"c0f65843385cfcf5","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md","title":"Strong Operator","display":"df-strong-operator — Strong Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-strong-operator","aliases":["58-df-strong-operator"],"display":"df-strong-operator — Strong Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","[[./58-df-directed.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[./58-df-function-set.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-strong-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-strong-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-operator — Strong Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1\" href=\"?note=1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1\" title=\"./58-df-directed.md\">58-df-directed.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa82947fba077a45\" href=\"?note=aa82947fba077a45\" title=\"./58-df-function-set.md\">58-df-function-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,T,T_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I\\in V\">\\(H,T,T_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I\\in V\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1\" href=\"?note=1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1\" title=\"./58-df-directed.md\">58-df-directed.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 固定同一组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\)</span> 数据，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span>。下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|x\\|=\\sqrt{B(\\langle x,x\\rangle)}\">\\(\\|x\\|=\\sqrt{B(\\langle x,x\\rangle)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x-y=+_H(\\langle x,\\odot_H(\\langle-1,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\">\\(x-y=+_H(\\langle x,\\odot_H(\\langle-1,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\)</span>。既有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\\)</span> 的存在结构式三参数接口保持不变；此处收敛极限中的范数及减法不再另选结构。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S(T_\\bullet,T,H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I,\\leq_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(T_\\bullet,I,H^H)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,H,H)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T_\\bullet(i),H,H)\\land\n\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists i_0\\in I\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;\n(\\langle i_0,i\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\to\\|T_\\bullet(i)(x)-T(x)\\|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S(T_\\bullet,T,H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I,\\leq_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(T_\\bullet,I,H^H)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,H,H)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T_\\bullet(i),H,H)\\land\n\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists i_0\\in I\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;\n(\\langle i_0,i\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\to\\|T_\\bullet(i)(x)-T(x)\\|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong operator convergence is pointwise norm convergence on Hilbert space vectors; the net is evaluated through the declared function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\bullet\">\\(T_\\bullet\\)</span> and the directed relation is used extensionally.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 